        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py#L838-L882> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
